## Project Layer Map

| Layer | Path | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Core | `lib/core/` | `WetarDatabase` (Drift), `WetarPlatformChannel`, `PlatformCapabilities`, `AppLogger`, `CacheManager`, Arabic/numeral helpers |
| Features | `lib/features/<name>/` | `player`, `library`, `music_folders`, `playlists`, `equalizer`, `lyrics`, `personalization`, `settings`, `onboarding` (`data/`, `domain/`, `presentation/`) |
| Localization | `lib/l10n/` | `app_en.arb` (LTR) & `app_ar.arb` (RTL, Egyptian-friendly Arabic) via `flutter gen-l10n` |
| Docs | `docs/` | Design spec, architecture, dependency audit, platform capabilities, manual QA checklist, release/CI guide |
| Tests | `test/` | Unit, BLoC, RTL/LTR widget, and golden tests |

